  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "October twenty twenty-six:",
      "start": 1,
      "end": 2.8
    },
    {
      "text": "two hundred sixteen earthquakes of magnitude",
      "start": 2.8,
      "end": 5.145
    },
    {
      "text": "five or greater, worldwide.",
      "start": 5.145,
      "end": 7.827
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a historical record.",
      "start": 9.6,
      "end": 11.156
    },
    {
      "text": "Each red dot marks one epicenter.",
      "start": 11.539,
      "end": 14.105
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch them appear,",
      "start": 15.2,
      "end": 16.593
    },
    {
      "text": "day by day.",
      "start": 16.593,
      "end": 17.801
    },
    {
      "text": "The most active area was the Vanuatu",
      "start": 33,
      "end": 35.287
    },
    {
      "text": "region, with fifty-seven earthquakes.",
      "start": 35.287,
      "end": 38.062
    },
    {
      "text": "Central America recorded thirty.",
      "start": 39.5,
      "end": 41.822
    },
    {
      "text": "The Indonesia region had twenty-four.",
      "start": 44,
      "end": 46.461
    },
    {
      "text": "The Japan, Kuril and Kamchatka region",
      "start": 48.5,
      "end": 51.101
    },
    {
      "text": "had sixteen.",
      "start": 51.101,
      "end": 52.447
    },
    {
      "text": "And the China and Central Asia",
      "start": 53.5,
      "end": 55.021
    },
    {
      "text": "region, fourteen.",
      "start": 55.021,
      "end": 56.797
    },
    {
      "text": "The other seventy-five were spread across",
      "start": 58.5,
      "end": 60.95
    },
    {
      "text": "the rest of the world.",
      "start": 60.95,
      "end": 62.401
    },
    {
      "text": "Most cluster along the boundaries of",
      "start": 64.5,
      "end": 66.404
    },
    {
      "text": "tectonic plates.",
      "start": 66.404,
      "end": 67.704
    },
    {
      "text": "The strongest was magnitude seven point",
      "start": 70,
      "end": 72.299
    },
    {
      "text": "seven, near Pitaloza Arriba,",
      "start": 72.299,
      "end": 74.307
    },
    {
      "text": "Panama, on October ninth.",
      "start": 74.307,
      "end": 76.734
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, magnitude seven point zero,",
      "start": 77.2,
      "end": 79.952
    },
    {
      "text": "near Nagqu, China,",
      "start": 79.952,
      "end": 81.217
    },
    {
      "text": "on October twenty-second.",
      "start": 81.217,
      "end": 82.959
    },
    {
      "text": "Then magnitude six point nine,",
      "start": 84.4,
      "end": 86.316
    },
    {
      "text": "near Ozernovskiy, Russia,",
      "start": 86.316,
      "end": 87.662
    },
    {
      "text": "on October sixteenth.",
      "start": 87.662,
      "end": 89.183
    },
    {
      "text": "And another six point nine,",
      "start": 91.6,
      "end": 93.144
    },
    {
      "text": "near Port-Olry, Vanuatu,",
      "start": 93.144,
      "end": 95.048
    },
    {
      "text": "on October twenty-fourth.",
      "start": 95.048,
      "end": 96.801
    },
    {
      "text": "Seven were at least three hundred kilometers",
      "start": 99.4,
      "end": 101.734
    },
    {
      "text": "deep, the largest magnitude six point five.",
      "start": 101.734,
      "end": 105.437
    },
    {
      "text": "In all, twenty-one reached magnitude six or",
      "start": 107.8,
      "end": 110.447
    },
    {
      "text": "greater, and two reached seven or greater.",
      "start": 110.447,
      "end": 113.605
    }
  ],
  "narrationStart": 1,
  "narrationEnd": 113.678,
